OL,3,GNEWSAReform leader 'getting to grips'
OL,4,Awith council finances
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Exhilarating, tiring, enjoyable,
OL,7,Fsometimes frustrating - but productive
OL,8,Foverall."
OL,10,FThat is how the Reform UK leader of
OL,11,FCalderdale Council, Dan Sutherland, has
OL,12,Fdescribed his first few months in the
OL,13,Frole.
OL,15,FIn May's elections, Reform UK won 34 of
OL,16,Fthe 54 seats available at Calderdale
OL,17,FCouncil.
