OL,3,GNEWSAReform leader 'getting to grips'
OL,4,Awith council finances
OL,5,
OL,6,FSutherland had been a Labour councillor
OL,7,Frepresenting Illingworth and Mixenden
OL,8,Fsince 2010 but defected to Reform in
OL,9,F2025, saying he believed Labour was "no
OL,10,Flonger in tune with his values".
